vikit_ros: read every camera model's intrinsics from the parameter_blackboard node.

Upstream 6f213c7 reads only Pinhole via getRemoteParam(); RationalPolynomial (the model
FAST-LIVO2-ROS2's avia_lvi / mid360_lvi launches use) and the others go through
getParam(nh, "parameter_blackboard/cam_width"), a local lookup on laserMapping that never
succeeds, so fx=0 and fastlivo_mapping dies with SIGFPE at start-up. Also wait up to
10 s (not 100 ms) for the blackboard's parameter service.

diff -ru a/vikit_ros/include/vikit/params_helper.h b/vikit_ros/include/vikit/params_helper.h
--- a/vikit_ros/include/vikit/params_helper.h	2026-09-28 02:12:51.850133045 +0900
+++ b/vikit_ros/include/vikit/params_helper.h	2026-09-28 02:12:51.850133045 +0900
@@ -114,7 +114,7 @@
     try {
         auto parameters_client = std::make_shared<rclcpp::SyncParametersClient>(nh, remote_node_name);
         // Wait briefly for the service to be available
-        if (parameters_client->wait_for_service(std::chrono::milliseconds(100))) {
+        if (parameters_client->wait_for_service(std::chrono::seconds(10))) {
             auto values = parameters_client->get_parameters({param_name});
             if (!values.empty() && values[0].get_type() != rclcpp::ParameterType::PARAMETER_NOT_SET) {
                 return values[0].get_value<T>();
